        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-ULTIMA-PC\"><b>Laurey Ultima Polished Chrome Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Polished Chrome Ultima Cabinet Pull is available in 4 sizes. The Polished Chrome finish is durable, making it ideal for high traffic cabinets such as those in the kitchen or in the bathroom. Each  of the Ultima Polished Chrome Cabinet Pulls come packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey Ultima Polished Chrome Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Polished Chrome</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LAU-41526:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3-3/4\" (96mm)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-41626:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 5\" (128mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-41726:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 6-1/4\" (160mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-41826:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 7-1/2\" (192mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
